.s23.s23.s23 {text-align:justify; padding-top:9px; padding-bottom:0px; font-family:"Times New Roman"; font-size:20;}
</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://ACF2FB25-E55B-4CBF-B02C-7B0D605DB9FA/x-apple-ql-magic/C7936689-893F-48BC-861D-C8D39FCD8193.png" style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:31; height:540;"><div style="position:absolute; top:31; left:121; width:544; height:88;"><div class="s1"><p class="s20"><span class="s8">К эндокринн</span><span class="s8">ой системе</span><span class="s8"> относят следующие органы</span><span class="s21">: </span></p></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:139; left:186; width:323; height:345;"><div class="s1"><p class="s22"><span class="s12">1- гипоталамус</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">2 - </span><span class="s12">гипофиз</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">3- щитовидная</span><span class="s12"> </span><span class="s12">железа</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">4 - </span><span class="s12"> </span><span class="s12">вилочковая железа</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">5 - </span><span class="s12">надпочечники</span><span class="s12"> </span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">6 – островковый аппарат поджелу-дочной</span><span class="s12"> желез</span><span class="s12">ы</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">7 - </span><span class="s12">половые железы</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">8 - </span><span class="s12"> околощитовидные железы</span></p><p class="s23"><span class="s12">9 – </span><span class="s12">эпифиз</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position: relative; width:0; height: 0"><div class="loading-slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div style="position:absolute; top:240; left:0; width:720; height:60; font-family:Arial; font-size:48; text-align:center;">Загрузка…</div></div></div><style type="text/css">
.s24.s24.s24 {margin-left:27px; text-indent:-27px; padding-bottom:0px; font-family:"Times New Roman"; font-size:20;}
